{
  "name": "mackerel",
  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/fish/mackerel.py): an Atlantic mackerel, 35 cm -- a SPINDLE, round in section and pointed at both ends, the pointed snout, a big eye; two dorsal fins widely apart (the first spiny), the anal under the second, then FIVE FINLETS above and below (each row one sawtooth sheet) before a slender stalk with two small keels and a deeply FORKED stiff tail; the back iridescent blue-green with ~11 black WAVY BARS zig-zagging over it (painted strokes), the flanks and belly bright silver-white. A fast schooling SWIMMER (the fish's plumbing).",
